 usabilidade e facilitar o compartilhamento de conte\\\\u00fado nas redes sociais;</li><li>Assistir a v\\\\u00eddeos e apresenta\\\\u00e7\\\\u00f5es animadas diretamente no gov.br.</li></ul><p>Os cookies de terceiros no portal gov.br s\\\\u00e3o todos cookies de publicidade e multim\\\\u00eddia do Google. Esses terceiros coletar\\\\u00e3o e usar\\\\u00e3o dados de navega\\\\u00e7\\\\u00e3o tamb\\\\u00e9m para seus pr\\\\u00f3prios fins. O usu\\\\u00e1rio pode desativ\\\\u00e1-los direto no site da Google.</p><ul><li>Informativo oficial dos cookies de terceiros do Google (<a href=\\\\\\\"https://business.safety.google/adscookies\\\\\\\" target=\\\\\\\"_blank\\\\\\\">https://business.safety.google/adscookies</a>).</li><li>Pol\\\\u00edtica do Google (<a href=\\\\\\\"https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites?hl-pt-BR\\\\\\\" target=\\\\\\\"_blank\\\\\\\">https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites?hl-pt-BR</a>).</li></ul><p>O Google Analytics no portal gov.br tem recursos de relat\\\\u00f3rios de publicidade ativados, que coleta informa\\\\u00e7\\\\u00f5es adicionais por cookie da DoubleClick, como atividade da Web e de IDs de publicidade do dispositivo (atividade do aplicativo) (<a href=\\\\\\\"https://support.google.com/analytics/answer/2799357\\\\\\\" target=\\\\\\\"_blank\\\\\\\">https://support.google.com/analytics/answer/2799357</a>)</p><p>O portal gov.br n\\\\u00e3o tem controle sobre quais cookies de terceiros ser\\\\u00e3o ativados. Alguns cookies de terceiros que podem ser encontrados ao acessar o portal:</p><p>Dom\\\\u00ednios: Google, Youtube, DoubleClick.net</p>\\\", \\\"groupId\\\": \\\"cookies-de-terceiros\\\"}], \\\"purposeLabel\\\": \\\"Finalidade\\\", \\\"expiresLabel\\\": \\\"Vencimento\\\", \\\"cookieGroupsLabel\\\": \\\"\\\", \\\"lastUpdate\\\": \\\"\\\", \\\"optOutButton\\\": \\\"Gerenciar cookies\\\", \\\"mainTitle\\\": \\\"Configura\\\\u00e7\\\\u00f5es avan\\\\u00e7adas de cookies\\\", \\\"domainLabel\\\": \\\"Dom\\\\u00ed